malized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0152","question_id":"CQ-Q0152","citation_id":"smp-43fff8aa6242444cbd98bf789df35b42:17","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0152","question_id":"CQ-Q0152","citation_id":"smp-43fff8aa6242444cbd98bf789df35b42:18","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0152","question_id":"CQ-Q0152","citation_id":"smp-43fff8aa6242444cbd98bf789df35b42:19","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0152","question_id":"CQ-Q0152","citation_id":"smp-43fff8aa6242444cbd98bf789df35b42:20","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0152","question_id":"CQ-Q0152","citation_id":"smp-43fff8aa6242444cbd98bf789df35b42:21","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0152","question_id":"CQ-Q0152","citation_id":"smp-43fff8aa6242444cbd98bf789df35b42:22","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0152","question_id":"CQ-Q0152","citation_id":"smp-43fff8aa6242444cbd98bf789df35b42:23","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0152","question_id":"CQ-Q0152","question_text":"给达人群发消息后无人回复怎么办？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":24,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":12,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"1f153fba579ac0d127973d6a4e2578953ccf5e0f260eb5a52bd4abc6c8db9c32","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 达人群发消息没人回复：先找原因，再做跟进，最后优化建联\n> 先说常识：达人每天几十上百条合作私信，**纯群发模板消息天然回复率低，正常建联回复率普遍只有5%-10%**，不是你一个人遇到这个问题\n\n## 一、先判断为什么没人回（最常见4个原因）\n1. **一看就是群发**：话术一模一样，没有提达人账号、作品，达人一眼判定是机器批量广告，直接跳过不看\n2. **信息模糊，没讲利益**：只说“想合作带货”，没写佣金、寄样、品的卖点、店铺数据；达人不会主动问你条件\n3. **达人匹配度差**：品类、粉丝画像、内容风格和你的产品不匹配；或者达人橱窗已经在卖同类竞品，没必要接你的品\n4. **发送时间不对**：直播时段、深夜发消息，消息被大量信息淹没；达人一般下播后、下午空闲才看商务消息\n\n## 二、当下怎么跟进（不要疯狂轰炸！）\n1. **筛选名单**：把达人分成A（高度匹配）、B（一般匹配）、C（泛匹配），只重点跟进A类达人，C类可以暂时放弃\n2. **跟进节奏（最多2次追加）**\n    - 第1次跟进：**3天后**，简短提醒，**不能重复粘贴原来的长文案**，补充1个亮点（例如：这款近期同类达人单条视频出XX单，免费寄样）\n    - 第2次跟进：**第7天**，最后一次触达；依旧无回复，直接放弃，不要再发，避免被标记骚扰\n3. **优先换渠道**：中腰部以上达人，优先找主页商务微信/邮箱联系，平台私信很容易被淹没\n4. **A类优质达人：放弃群发，改成**轻度个性化**\n    开头带上：**看了你XX那条视频**，证明不是批量群发，回复率提升明显\n\n### 可直接套用的精简建联话术（短，手机一眼看完）\n> XX你好，看完你【XX主题视频】，风格和我们这款XX产品很契合。佣金XX%，支持免费寄样，店铺好评率XX，近期同类达人短视频稳定出单。\n> 感兴趣可以回复，我发产品资料+货盘。\n\n## 三、长期优化，提高下一批建联回复率\n1. **减少纯群发量，提升精准度**：少广撒网，建联前看达人橱窗、视频，确认他能带同类产品，再发消息；宁可一天20条个性化，也不要200条纯复制群发\n2. **消息结构（4要素，控制4行内，拒绝小作文）**\n    ① 针对性一句话（看过他哪条作品）\n    ② 你是谁+产品\n    ③ 达人收益（佣金/免费样品/投放支持）\n    ④ 明确行动：感兴趣回复，发资料\n3. **发送时间**：避开直播时段，优先**下午14:00–16:00，或者下播后1小时**\n4. **准备佐证材料**：货盘表、产品卖点、同类达人带货数据截图，达人一回你就能马上发，减少来回沟通成本\n\n## 四、避坑提醒\n❌ 不要反复追问“在吗”“看到消息了吗”，容易被拉黑\n❌ 不要长篇大论品牌历史，达人没耐心读\n❌ 不要夸大收益，承诺不切实际的销量\n\n\n\n要不要我给你写2版跟进提醒话术（3天跟进版+7天最后触达版），你直接复制发给A类达人？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0152","question_id":"CQ-Q0152","citation_id":"smp-338aa88bd840447ebf2c880019720b0b:1","title":"心态修炼之——即使在群里发消息没人回复，也没关系啊！！ #创作灵感  #治愈系  #拒绝焦虑  #心理学  #温柔风","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7371851871050419482","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7371851871050419482","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0152","question_id":"CQ-Q0152","citation_id":"smp-338aa88bd840447ebf2c880019720b0b:2","title":"群里发信息没人回如何处理- 法律快车法律咨询","raw_url":"https://www.lawtime.cn/wenda/q_54365987.html","normalized_url":"https://www.lawtime.cn/wenda/q_54365987.html","host":"www.lawtime.cn","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0152","question_id":"CQ-Q0152","citation_id":"smp-338aa88bd840447ebf2c880019720b0b:3","title":"电商日记 Day 10｜达人邀约发了几十条没人回？问题出在这 #电商日记 #妙手打单 #打单发货 #电商运营 #电商干货","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7680749481867939112","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7680749481867939112","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0152","question_id":"CQ-Q0152","citation_id":"smp-338aa88bd840447ebf2c880019720b0b:4","title":"怎么提高群聊回应率？群里说话没人理，分享或提问半天没动静，看着孤零零的消息想撤回？大概率不是被无视，而是遇到了“群体漠视”。其实很简单，试试这两个小技巧：  1️⃣艾特关键人：挑一两个你觉得最可能回应","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7595461760997669297","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7595461760997669297","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0152","question_id":"CQ-Q0152","citation_id":"smp-338aa88bd840447ebf2c880019720b0b:5","title":"一点心理学 | 好安静，我以为我们一直有话说","raw_url":"http://m.jyt.henan.gov.cn/2025/09-16/3227020.html","normalized